# Scripts (`scripts/`)

- Keep scripts idempotent where practical and explicit about required env vars.
- Use safe shell defaults where appropriate (`set -euo pipefail`) and quote variable expansions unless intentionally unquoted.
- Prefer deterministic local paths under repo workspace; avoid hidden side effects outside project directories.
- Document expected prerequisites inline in script comments when non-obvious.
- After edits, run the script path or closest dry-run/check command when feasible.

## Rule self-review

When this rule materially guided the task, follow **Rules self-review** in `autopulse-execution.mdc` and apply it to this file.
